@dotnet_test_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### Get all players
GET {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players
Accept: application/json

###

### Get player by id
GET {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players/12345
Accept: application/json

###

### Create player
POST {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "12348",
  "daysSinceJoined": 30,
  "mostBetSport": "Football",
  "favouriteTeam": "Scotland",
  "mostBetType": "Bet Builder",
  "averageStake": 12.50,
  "lastLoginDaysAgo": 6,
  "riskLevel": "Low",
  "isSelfExcluded": false,
  "coolingOffUntilUtc": null,
  "jurisdictionCode": "UK",
  "isRecommendationRestricted": false,
  "sportMix30d": 0.80,
  "betTypeMix30d": 0.75,
  "stakeStdDev30d": 9.50,
  "timeOfDayFitScore": 0.60
}

###

### Update player
PUT {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players/12345
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "playerId": "12345",
  "daysSinceJoined": 181,
  "mostBetSport": "Football",
  "favouriteTeam": "Scotland",
  "mostBetType": "Bet Builder",
  "averageStake": 13.00,
  "lastLoginDaysAgo": 1,
  "riskLevel": "Low",
  "isSelfExcluded": false,
  "coolingOffUntilUtc": null,
  "jurisdictionCode": "UK",
  "isRecommendationRestricted": false,
  "sportMix30d": 0.85,
  "betTypeMix30d": 0.81,
  "stakeStdDev30d": 10.00,
  "timeOfDayFitScore": 0.66
}

###

### Delete player
DELETE {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players/12345?version=1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create duplicate (expect 409)
POST {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "12345",
  "daysSinceJoined": 10,
  "mostBetSport": "Football",
  "favouriteTeam": "Scotland",
  "mostBetType": "Bet Builder",
  "averageStake": 5.00,
  "lastLoginDaysAgo": 0,
  "riskLevel": "Low",
  "isSelfExcluded": false,
  "coolingOffUntilUtc": null,
  "jurisdictionCode": "UK",
  "isRecommendationRestricted": false,
  "sportMix30d": 0.70,
  "betTypeMix30d": 0.70,
  "stakeStdDev30d": 8.00,
  "timeOfDayFitScore": 0.60
}

###

### Create with invalid data (expect 400)
POST {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "",
  "daysSinceJoined": -1,
  "mostBetSport": "",
  "favouriteTeam": "",
  "mostBetType": "",
  "averageStake": -1,
  "lastLoginDaysAgo": -2,
  "riskLevel": "",
  "isSelfExcluded": false,
  "coolingOffUntilUtc": null,
  "jurisdictionCode": "",
  "isRecommendationRestricted": false,
  "sportMix30d": -0.1,
  "betTypeMix30d": 1.2,
  "stakeStdDev30d": -2,
  "timeOfDayFitScore": 2
}

###

### Recommendations for player 1 (Scotland, Low risk) with generated content
POST {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players/12345/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxResults": 3
}

###

### Recommendations for player 3 (Horse Racing, High risk) with generated content or deterministic fallback
POST {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players/12347/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxResults": 5
}

###

### Recommendations for player 2 (Tennis, Medium risk) when Claude is unavailable
# If Claude is not configured, the response still includes a deterministic content object.
POST {{dotnet_test_HostAddress}}/api/players/12346/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxResults": 1
}

###
